{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/pulls/157","id":4786818108,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSnV9Ys8AAAABHVEMPA","html_url":"https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/pull/157","diff_url":"https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/pull/157.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/pull/157.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/issues/157","number":157,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"evidence(p8-004): archive sealed temporal evaluation and verified raw-only replay","user":{"login":"jyqj","id":174292474,"node_id":"U_kgDOCmN9-g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174292474?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj","html_url":"https://github.com/jyqj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyqj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 目的\n\nP8-004 已由并行 PR #156 合入完成。本 PR 为同一个原任务追加独立的 Boltons prospective temporal-v2 封存评测与审查证据，完整保留失败质量门；任务数保持 **192 总计 / 163 done / 29 remaining**。\n\n## 本 PR 内容\n\n- 保留候选首次封存、独立新作者和 gold reviewer 的实际启动、原题初稿/一次封存前修订、有限公开 DEV 关系审查、原生零查询 freeze/validate、真实数据封存和一次性许可的原始链条。\n- 固定 `2cd04485b0e0b23483f64671d56538bbaa47f442`、Boltons commit `4e5faa3d7e4008d89e0d8bf1ea87b6d9a061a16d`、同一真实 release 包/配置/scorer（显式 local-text-hidden：text/hidden=true，auto_index=false；臂名 default 不代表原默认索引配置）；一次执行48题×两臂×3次重复，全部288条结果保留。\n- 原 run [37769636440](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/actions/runs/37769636440) 的 Actions failure / helper exit 1 和 candidate gate_failed 原样保存。有答案 Top-1 0.175、nDCG@10 0.1891629278415609；24条无答案记录全部失败。rg基线exit0只代表baseline记录，不是质量认证。\n- 完整保存正式执行的两个原始 ZIP、全部成员与校验信息；独立审查覆盖288条测量、252条命中、323份原始输入与配对统计。随后实际运行冻结的 [raw-only replay 37773318110](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/actions/runs/37773318110)：新增产品查询为0、原始文件不变、重放报告字节相同、质量门失败原样保留。两个重放 ZIP 也完整归档。独立原始数据审查、独立实际重放审查与最终人工验收已分别完成，最终人工决策为 `accepted_original_p8_004_procedure_scope_as_supplemental_evidence`。\n- 所有新增实现文件均为归档中的固定历史测量/回收工具副本；主分支生产源码、Cargo、scripts、tests、.github 和两份并存 DEV 语料保留 PR #156 已合入 Git 对象。\n\n## 原任务与范围\n\n192个原任务定义、依赖、步骤、验收和回滚条款不变；仅给已 done 的 P8-004 追加证据并按原 renderer 同步任务视图。没有重复计数。新增结果不能认证 #156 后来的产品版本；完整 V19/G8、100k、真实语义效果、跨平台发行和 P7-018 live provider 仍按原状态处理。此套已使用题目已退役，不能再称为后续调优候选的未见 holdout。\n\n## 验证\n\n- [最终报告](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/7d72f3c3aec1ecfe688a533cd301387d63f38a87/artifacts/benchmarks/prospective-temporal-v2/FINAL-REPORT.md)、[证据索引](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/7d72f3c3aec1ecfe688a533cd301387d63f38a87/artifacts/benchmarks/prospective-temporal-v2/index.json)、[原 P8-004 人工验收](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/7d72f3c3aec1ecfe688a533cd301387d63f38a87/artifacts/benchmarks/prospective-temporal-v2/workflow-control/reviews/P8_004_manual_acceptance.json)。\n- 固定最终提交 `7d72f3c3aec1ecfe688a533cd301387d63f38a87`；[最终范围/任务视图独立审查](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/1dff3832ca26a0e1ae8be97900c6fb819f34ee3f/artifacts/checkpoints/pr157-final-review-20261008/independent-final-scope-review.json) 与 [192 个原任务逐字段独立核对](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/1dff3832ca26a0e1ae8be97900c6fb819f34ee3f/artifacts/checkpoints/pr157-final-review-20261008/independent-original-192-task-accounting.json) 均通过。原定义、验收、依赖和回滚未改，原 153 done /39 remaining →163/29，恰好10项完成；本补充PR新增完成数0。\n- 三套原 CI 均 attempt 1 成功：[CI 37777427050](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/actions/runs/37777427050)、[P7 engineering 37777427130](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/actions/runs/37777427130)、[P7 closeout 37777427153](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/actions/runs/37777427153)。八个 job 全部成功。主 check 的35步骤成功；各作业原条件 skip/ignored 保留。\n- 实际日志确认 Python 46/239/174 三组检查完成、v14 schema9 / product `1ed3c7df...` / complete_inputs1082 passed，当前任务 SHA `6e2ab2e90cbd820228e8ff397d70c770561ba20d3110e6eca31338f29a945207` 一致。CI/工程作业的合并预览 `379c0f6...` 与PR最终提交具有同一完整Git树，四个closeout job直接检出最终提交。\n- [独立最终 CI / 合并审查](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/1dff3832ca26a0e1ae8be97900c6fb819f34ee3f/artifacts/checkpoints/pr157-final-review-20261008/independent-final-ci-and-merge-review.json)：`accepted_scoped_ready_to_merge_exact_head`，未解决阻断0。[八个job完整日志清单](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/1dff3832ca26a0e1ae8be97900c6fb819f34ee3f/artifacts/checkpoints/pr157-final-review-20261008/complete-original-ci-log-manifest.json)保存4,728,244字节，全部Git原字节回读校验，并与主check直接取得的原日志一致。[完整审查入口](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/1dff3832ca26a0e1ae8be97900c6fb819f34ee3f/artifacts/checkpoints/pr157-final-review-20261008/README.md)。\n- [CI 结束后的服务观察](https://github.com/jyqj/codecortex/blob/1dff3832ca26a0e1ae8be97900c6fb819f34ee3f/artifacts/checkpoints/pr157-final-review-20261008/post-ci-custody-observation.json)：两固定执行head各仍只有1个run/attempt1；正式评测failure、只读重放success和原许可ref不变。这是绑定具体head与观察时点的记录，不扩大为全局持续观察。\n\n评测质量失败与证据/重放/CI的流程验收分别记录。原早期失败、null/inconclusive、条件skip/ignored和未执行项均保留；历史工具的open/not_granted不被改写，完整V19/G8及发行质量仍未认证。\n\n## 合并\n\n已取得当前head与base的独立可合并结论；此描述更新时实际合并尚未执行，合并结果将在完成后追加。","created_at":"2026-10-08T12:31:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T13:05:39Z","closed_at":"2026-10-08T13:05:38Z","merged_at":"2026-10-08T13:05:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"7354db236c9d9850a75f31672697ae9eab44565e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/pulls/157/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/pulls/157/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyqj/codecortex/